Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:24.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《精灵旅社3：疯狂假期》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,布达佩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站 布达佩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next stop's Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,布达佩斯是下一站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Budapest is the next stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,布达佩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.87,0:00:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,车票 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tickets, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oop, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的 - 还有我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here's mine. - And mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有我的 - 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mine, too! - Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢天 我讨厌伪装成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I hate wearing disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这高跟鞋简直要了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}These heels are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, take it down a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让人类警惕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to alarm the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 Drac\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psst. Drac.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 要 吓死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to und freak out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一只可爱的小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a nice kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一只小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm und kitty-cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喵 喵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meow. Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 别又是这个小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, not this clown again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 旅客们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.89,0:01:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Abraham Van Helsing教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Professor Abraham Van Helsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 Van Helsings家族的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. One of the Van Helsings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个世纪以来 我的家族一直在保护人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}For centuries, my family has protected humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,免受邪恶怪兽的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the evils of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们可以相信我 我告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can believe me when I tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有怪兽藏在你们中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are monsters hiding amongst you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But fear not,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是专家 我知道怎样才能把这些野兽赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I am a professional, and I know how to flush out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们的身份揭晓在众人面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}these beasts and bring them into the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.77,0:02:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终是我 第一个杀死了Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally! First I kill Dracula,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀光了其余的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then the rest of the monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么一直这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爸爸 你的爷爷 你的曾曾祖母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad, your grandfather, your great-great-granny…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全被我打败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I defeated them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候你们Van Helsings才能学会放下仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will you Van Helsings ever learn to let go of the hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不 因为你 是一个怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never! Because you, monster, are a…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,吱吱 吱吱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, squeak, squeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 怎么是一只老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? A mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的 黑暗之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run from me, Prince of Darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远追捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will hunt you for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 在毁灭掉你之前我将永不停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear I will never rest until I destroy you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster… Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's the last thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 那家伙真烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that guy is annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许某天会有这样一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one day there will be a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽们到那儿可以远离这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}where monsters can go to get away from it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,度个假\N{\fnArial\fs30}take a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还能结婚 谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows, maybe even get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂不美哉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't that be something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧 婚礼到底什么时候开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, when is this thing starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他们弄哭了 Wayne\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, you made them cry, Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All except this little one. Coochie-coochie…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是Sunny 她不会哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sunny. She doesn't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:04:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她会咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是对你非常重要的时刻 Carl\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very special moment, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你美丽的新娘随时都会走上红毯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any second, your beautiful bride is going to walk right down the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 Drac 她不会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Drac, she's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.03,0:05:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis和她在一起呢 我相信一切都在掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis is with her. I'm sure everything is under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavey 一切都还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavey, is everything under control?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 还好 只是她有点婚前紧张的小问题罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yep, just a slight case of pre-wedding jitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿 我这儿一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, everything is fine here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucy 试着放松一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please try to relax, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.89,0:05:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我会帮你打理好一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've taken care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证给你一个完美的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wedding is going to be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么才能确定 我做了正确的选择呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, how do I know I'm doing the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我明白你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know just how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁给Johnny那天 是我人生中最幸福的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day I married Johnny was the best day of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却超级紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可没我紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as nervous as I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该看看我爸爸当时的样子 他紧张得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should have seen my dad. He was a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上我甚至都不愿从我的棺材里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't get out of my coffin that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.62,0:06:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他知道一切都是命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he knew it was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter where you come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是多么的与众不同 这些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}or how different you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,心动这种事 一生中只有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Zing only happens once in your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要珍惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have to cherish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的好有道理 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 呃 好的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Uh… Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.31,0:06:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到那个声音了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.35,0:06:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了 我以为我们把他关在他的房间里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I thought we locked him in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是把他关好了 没错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 妈咪 嗨 外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mom. Hi, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dennis！- Dennis！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dennis! - Dennis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到Tinkles在哭 所以我们就把他放出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tinkles was crying, so we let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tinkles 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tinkles, sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 当初是谁出的馊主意让Dennis养了个小狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Whose idea was it to let Dennis have a puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 好像是您的主意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的Tinkles\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Tinkles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说宝贝 我知道你很爱Tinkles\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, honey, I know you love Tinkles,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不能带着我们的狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're not allowed to bring our dogs…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们的宠物 到处跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… I mean, our pets everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 我沉浸在爱河里 ∮ - ∮ 我爱上了一个怪兽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ I'm in love ∮ - ∮ I'm in love with a monster ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是DJ Jazzy Johnny\N{\fnArial\fs30}DJ Jazzy Johnny in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.01,0:07:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 让我们有请这对幸福的新婚夫妇 Prickles夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to welcome the happy couple, Mr. and Mrs. Prickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,新娘新郎邀请大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bride and groom invite everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起加入舞池\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join them on the dance floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 永远永远 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Always and forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一起跳个舞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:08:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 和你在一起的每一个瞬间 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Each moment with you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Watch out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身上的每一处都太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got stitches in all the right places.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会是你的亲戚吧Frank\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there's no way that is related to you, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错她是我右胳膊主人的表亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's my right arm's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ay! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 阿 我看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Ah! I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank希望我来见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank wanted me to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的胳膊是表亲 隔了两代\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're arm cousins, twice removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肱二头肌我走到哪都能认出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd recognize that bicep anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为 既然我们俩都单身 说不定能一见如故\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought, since we're both single, we might hit it off,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们能来一场约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe go on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Date"? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 额 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, eh, it's just that, eh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.97,0:08:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,DJ台可是个神圣的地方 别捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The DJ booth is a sacred space!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱这首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this song!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dracula?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 他去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dracula？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dracula?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 Drac 你不喜欢她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Drac, you didn't like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但是你不能鸡蛋里挑骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but you can't be too picky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经100年没有约会过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't had a date in 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 很感谢你们的关心 但没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, guys, I appreciate your concern, but it's not up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人只能心动一次 我心动过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only Zing once, and I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代在变 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times have changed, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在甚至可以在手机上跟某个人相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can even find someone to Zing with on your phone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm far too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有Mavis和Dennis 还有旅馆 「给我血 给我血”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have Mavis and Dennis and the hotel, and bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 伙计们 你们听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, did you guys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚才真的在说 「给我血 给我血”\N{\fnArial\fs30}He actually said, "Bleh, bleh-bleh."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不说 「给我血 给我血」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't say, "Bleh, bleh-bleh"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 额 我在寻找爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, uh, I'm looking for a Zing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 更换手机铃声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Changing phone ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我想要一次约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm looking for a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和某个人出去见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟我开玩笑嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听不明白吗 我想要次约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it? I want to go on a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 你想要火腿肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want baloney.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 看看那头发 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Look at that hair. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 眼睛太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Too many eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛太少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too few eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对长触角的不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not into tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,匹配成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Match found"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,最为重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是闹着玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not into games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好有份工作 而且我的猫必须喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better have a job, and my cats have to like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天呐 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, whoa, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 Mavis 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Mavis! Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 你在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚在检查蜜月套房 听到有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just checking on the honeymoon suite, and I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对不起 我的小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, my little bedbug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚在收拾阁楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just cleaning the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:11:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太脏了 呃 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so dirty, ah, yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁 - 你在打电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is that? - Are you on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 这个吗 我打算找个女佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, this? I was just trying to find a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来帮我收拾这些乱七八糟的 - 找个女佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to help me with the mess. - A maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我会看看你的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, I'll check your references.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再打给你 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get back to you. Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我遮遮掩掩的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to hide it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,遮遮掩掩 谁 什么意思 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide? Who? I mean, what? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我知道你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你工作得太辛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stressed out from working too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅社太大了 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big hotel, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能都照顾得过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也一直很忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty busy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 虽然看起来我们一起工作的时间更多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It seems like now that we're working together more,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,却见到彼此更少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're seeing each other less.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 对 你说的都对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Yeah. You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我工作得太多了 你工作得也太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am working too much, you're working too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的该休息下 比如就现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should really take a break, starting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安慢走不送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night-night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嘿 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Hey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好今晚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}date night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 爸爸说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dad's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是需要休息一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要都聚在一起 像个家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to all be together again, like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,像以前那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否因工作过量而精疲力竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you overworked and stressed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否需要阖家出行走遍万水千山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need some family time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否是个怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you need a vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.69,0:12:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次怪兽旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}a monster vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 出发吧 出发吧 出发吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Sail away, sail away, sail away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎乘坐小妖精航空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard Gremlin Air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.39,0:13:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看向机舱的前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}please direct your attention to the front of the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了您的安全 请解开安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your safety, please unbuckle your seat belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在航行中 我们很有可能会经历客舱失压\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the likely event we experience a sudden drop in cabin pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将为您提供氧气面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}oxygen will be provided.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,行李需要我帮您放起来吗先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I stow that for you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒 饮料 矿泉水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverages. Snacks. Beverages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生 瓜子 八宝粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverages. Snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,八-宝-粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咖啡需要吗 - 太感谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coffee? - That would be lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis 求你了 你这简直就是折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis, please, you're torturing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我讨厌惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I hate surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个有趣的惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a fun surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no fun surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能先告诉我我们要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及为何我们在飞机上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we on a plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己明明就可以飞的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can fly, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那个年代 人们都是坐火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in my day, people took trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才叫品味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对 爸 四十个小时挤在一个小隔间里最有品位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Dad. Forty hours in a closet-sized room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你和Bernie叔叔在里面抽难闻的雪茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you and Uncle Bernie and his smelly cigars,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还争论着哪个男人更帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}arguing who was more attractive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cleopatra还是Nefertiti\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleopatra or Nefertiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nefertiti\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nefertiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 谢谢你 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Dad, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis Mavis 这可真是个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis, this is such an amazing surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及和我最爱的人们一起去度假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to spend time with the people I love most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我求求你 告诉我一下目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I beg of you, tell me where we're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 我已经准备好了一切 你不用操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. I've taken care of everything, so you don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近压力太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been so stressed out lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候歇歇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for you to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, isn't that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}So relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看那个谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check on you-know-who.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去趟厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你看到那个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis去厕所了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis went to the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,额…好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psst. Hey, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这啊 Tinkles\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, Tinkles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们不会把你一个人丢在家里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we'd never leave you home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.72,0:15:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 你们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, folks, you're free to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在机舱里随意走动 因为我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the cabin, as we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开始降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}started our descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,周末有什么计划吗 Bill\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, any big plans for the weekend there, Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:15:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 和往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know, the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要带孩子们去踢足球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to take the kids to soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒 饮料 矿泉水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snacks. Beverages.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生 瓜子 八宝粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snacks. Beverages. Snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 我们已经到达目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, we've arrived at our destination,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,百慕大三角洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Bermuda Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到百慕大三角洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Bermuda Triangle,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将在这里展开一场惊心动魄的游轮之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you'll embark on a monster cruise of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘游轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cruise?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 你… 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you… No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只是一个在水上的旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's just like a hotel on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.77,0:17:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得你需要一个假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just figured you need a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再为其他人的假期操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}from running everyone else's vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几乎不出旅馆 自从\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've barely been out of the hotel since…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从妈妈去世以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, since Mom died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是一次我们全家一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is a chance to make new memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造新的回忆的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Dennis一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船 - 船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boat! - Boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁带大了你这么棒的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who made you such an amazing daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是个了不起的老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a father I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 Denisovich 我们上船吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Denisovich, let's get cruising!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.89,0:19:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 笑一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.03,0:19:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,宠物禁止入内\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No pets allowed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎登船 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard. How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dennis 快点 - 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dennis, come on. - Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lovely shirt. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你好 欢迎登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello. Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是Bob\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this is Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你好 Bob\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hi, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 Bob\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hi, Bob."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的天啊 Griffin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh, Griffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我好激动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, like, so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我去过最棒的旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, like, the nicest hotel I've ever been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这也太炫酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这么多好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so much to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥运标准泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olympic-size swimming pool…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,自助餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All-you-can-eat buffet…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,全套服务的SPA\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full-service spa…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我要做个海草磨皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! I'm gonna get me a seaweed rewrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 听上去这里能做的所有项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, it sounds like everything we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们自己的旅馆都能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}at our hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了它是在水上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except on the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.73,0:20:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你安排得太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nailed it, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.84,0:20:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爸会爱死这一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad is going to love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有史以来最棒的假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best summer vacation ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:20:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后的行程会更棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you see the itinerary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.91,0:21:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 我讨厌烟花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, "fire bad." Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 没错 但是 也许你会在这邮轮上找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, right, but, uh, maybe you'll find.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于你自己「不一样的烟火」 也说不定呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}your own fireworks on the cruise, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 这不是艘爱情的小船好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the Love Boat, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里 只是为了和家人共度好时光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here to have fun with my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.67,0:21:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.87,0:21:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahoy there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 那是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.49,0:21:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是船长Ericka\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Captain Ericka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错 我是人类 但不要因此而对我有成见噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, I'm human. But don't hold that against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有幸邀请大家来到史上第一个怪兽邮轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not be more excited to have all of you on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的让我 太激动啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}our first-ever monster cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.91,0:22:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eeny feeny fanny foonyah wah wah？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eeny feeny fanny foonyah wah wah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不 他心脏病发作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! He's having a heart attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drac? Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在他心脏插一根木棍 才能让他犯心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the only heart attack that can hurt him is with a wooden stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那肯定就是中风了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be a stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.82,0:22:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我觉得可能是因为她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I think it might be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别乱戳 先生 我站在这呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Watch where you're pointing, mister, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.79,0:22:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是贴着我站\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always stand so close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪瘆人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽们在黑暗中隐姓埋名地生活了太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For so long, monsters were hiding, living in the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不再需要这样生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以站起来挥舞你们的手臂 爪子 或触角\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've stood up and waved your hand or claw or tentacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声宣告 我们在这里 我们就是毛茸茸的 我们有权利长得吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and said, "We're here, we're hairy, and it is our right to be scary!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时此刻 让我们狂欢庆祝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time to celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在到达目的地前的旅程里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll enjoy gourmet dining, thrilling adventures,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.21,0:22:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将品尝到珍馐美馔 体验激动人心的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nonstop entertainment,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 永无休止的娱乐项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}all on the way to our final destination,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座沉没的岛屿 已不再沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lost city that isn't lost anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.19,0:22:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚特兰提斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.16,0:22:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢 这些鱼是杂技演员耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! The fish are acrobats!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.30,0:23:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是鱼技演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're fishcrobats!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. How y'all doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.71,0:23:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,您一定就是举世无双的Dracula了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be the one and only Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.15,0:23:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家好不容易才把你盼来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have waited so long to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你真的是不会变老啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you really don't age, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.85,0:23:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死都想要你那好皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would kill for your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.29,0:23:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eh doobeeday shoolah eh koobeeday？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh doobeeday shoolah eh koobeeday?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.69,0:23:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你在讲精灵语啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. You're speaking Transylvanian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家一直好想学呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Always wanted to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，eh doobeeday shoolah koobeeday？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, eh doobeeday shoolah koobeeday?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Eh koobeeday。- Koobeeday\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eh koobeeday. - Koobeeday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.07,0:23:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Eh koobeeday。- Koobeeday\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eh koobeeday. - Koobeeday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doolah-day shoolah koobeeday\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh doobeeday shoolah koobeeday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.74,0:23:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真是门浪漫的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, such a romantic language.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.98,0:23:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道为什么 带一点口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's just something about an accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.91,0:23:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是会让男人听上去很有头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that makes a man sound so intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.31,0:23:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alibooboo\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alibooboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在讲精灵语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Transylvanian right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是 很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's saying it's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:24:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 我也 alibooboo\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then "alibooboo" to you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.39,0:24:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Alibooboo Alibooboo - Drac Drac 振作点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alibooboo. Alibooboo. - Drac! Drac, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.93,0:24:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会儿 我早就想这么干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I've always wanted to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.86,0:24:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 醒醒吧 Drac\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up! Wake up, Drac!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.93,0:24:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 行了行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.70,0:24:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 哥们 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.00,0:24:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.67,0:24:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.04,0:24:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.11,0:24:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.64,0:24:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,动心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zinged.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.67,0:24:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我去到摩托车店 说 卖了它 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I went to the moped store, I said, "Sell it" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.81,0:24:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 售货员说 嗨 你的预算是多少 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Salesman's like, "What up? What's your budget?" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我说 我实际上对摩托车一无所知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And I'm like, "Honestly, I don't know nothin' about mopeds" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.05,0:24:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他说 那我知道给你哪辆了 跟我来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He said, "I got the one for you, follow me" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.38,0:25:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 噢 太酷了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ooh, it's too real ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.35,0:25:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一个镀铬的玻璃 我不需要挡风玻璃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A chromed-out mirror, I don't need a windshield ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.70,0:25:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这真是美妙的一天 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's a lovely day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh! - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.73,0:25:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.83,0:25:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.81,0:25:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,走你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.24,0:25:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 秀色可餐噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.19,0:25:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.86,0:25:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再会 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Auf Wiedersehen ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.19,0:25:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 非常感谢 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Danke schoen ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.34,0:25:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿童俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Kids Club."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.13,0:26:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是儿童俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a kids club?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.30,0:26:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whee！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whee！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.80,0:26:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鱼 - 是的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fish. - That's right, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.34,0:26:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still not sure I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.94,0:26:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会专门照顾我的孩子们 一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take my kids, all day, on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.48,0:26:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.91,0:26:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.18,0:26:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底还有什么不明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.35,0:26:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? Ow! - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.22,0:26:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们可以玩得很开心 你也可以玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they can have a great time, and you can have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.29,0:26:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不要担心 你可以在晚上把它们接回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry, you get them back at the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.83,0:26:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.23,0:26:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧 聊胜于无\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well. That's better than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.17,0:26:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.14,0:27:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.21,0:27:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.84,0:27:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 我们想做什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we do whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.25,0:27:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Whatever we want"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.42,0:27:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的什么都可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.89,0:27:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we want!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.13,0:27:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别走 救命 - 想干啥就干啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! Help me! - Whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.93,0:27:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们想干嘛就干嘛 - 我们想干嘛就干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever we want. - Whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.50,0:27:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How y'all doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.17,0:27:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 晚上好 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. - Good evening, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.34,0:27:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 噢 我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello. Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.34,0:27:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.21,0:27:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意 呃 抬一下尾巴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind, uh, lifting your tail? You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.88,0:27:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.15,0:27:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.85,0:27:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.32,0:27:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎乘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.18,0:28:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 曾祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! You were so right, Great-Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.25,0:28:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽们真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters are disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.15,0:28:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们禽兽不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.95,0:28:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dracula在船上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dracula, is he on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.29,0:28:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我见到他了 面对面 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I saw him. Face-to-face. Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.59,0:29:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他很客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so nice to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.22,0:29:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那苍白的脸和愚蠢的傻笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That pale face of his and his goofy smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.53,0:29:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,炫耀着他的尖牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}showing off his fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.23,0:29:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 跟你对我说的一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh, it's just like you taught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.03,0:29:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是可怕至极好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's even worse than I feared!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.60,0:29:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个不祥之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was that fateful night that I realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.70,0:29:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到 人类无法永远打败怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}a human could never defeat a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.44,0:29:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我不能看着家族传承断送在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wouldn't let our family legacy die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我开始找办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, I began to search for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.25,0:29:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后终于让我在古书中 找到一份无敌破坏乐谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw it in an ancient text, an instrument of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.52,0:29:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏力强到可以摧毁亚特兰提斯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}so powerful it destroyed Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.06,0:29:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一整座城的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}a whole city of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.96,0:29:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在废墟深处 等待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there, deep within the rubble, it lay, waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.23,0:29:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在找这座失落之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Endlessly, I searched for the lost city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.04,0:29:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着时间流逝 我的身体越来越令我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time passed, and my body began to fail me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.54,0:29:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这是一个悲伤的故事 Ericka\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was so sad, Ericka.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.14,0:29:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是我的肝 再是我的脾\N{\fnArial\fs30}First my liver, then my spleen,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着是肾 两颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed by a kidney or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.32,0:30:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我美丽的金发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then my golden locks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.99,0:30:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这并不会阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wouldn't let that stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.52,0:30:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用机器取代败坏的器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I replaced my failing organs with technology!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.49,0:30:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.20,0:30:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.10,0:30:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.70,0:30:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真是改良版的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, girl, it's an improvement, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.67,0:30:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.01,0:30:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于啊 120年后的今天 让我找到了亚特兰提斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, after 120 years, I have finally found Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.68,0:30:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 别管这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, forget about all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.51,0:30:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就去干掉Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get rid of Dracula right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.11,0:30:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他那么近的 我本来可以直接\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so close to him, I could've just…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.65,0:30:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.32,0:30:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要按计划来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.36,0:30:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些怪兽引到亚特兰提斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lure the monsters to Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.23,0:30:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到无敌破坏乐谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}retrieve the instrument of destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.59,0:30:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后设陷阱 再一网打尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}trap them there, and then wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.46,0:30:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单得很 Ericka\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simple, Ericka!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.30,0:30:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证 在那之前你不会杀了Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, promise me you won't try and kill Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.37,0:30:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.77,0:30:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我保证 - 保证什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I promise. - Promise what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.21,0:30:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证我不会杀掉Dracula 可以了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I won't try and kill Dracula. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.48,0:31:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.28,0:31:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 曾祖父 我不会试试能不能杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Great-Grandfather, I won't try and kill him…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.35,0:31:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会直接杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.82,0:31:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今夜 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Tonight… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.43,0:31:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我只想带你们嗨起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I just want to take you higher ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.40,0:31:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 同志们 把你们的戒指甩向天际 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Put yo' pinky rings up to the moon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.70,0:31:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮小妞们 ∮ - ∮ 都愣着干嘛 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Girls ∮ - ∮ What y'all tryin' to do? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.27,0:31:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 闪耀着金光的魔法在空气中璀璨夺目 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ 24-karat magic in the air ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.68,0:31:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 贯穿你整个身体 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Head-to-toe ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.85,0:31:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.32,0:31:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 注意了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Uh, look out ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.75,0:31:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 呦呦重头戏来了 ∮ - ∮ 无敌重头戏 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Pop, pop, it's showtime ∮ - ∮ Showtime ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.22,0:31:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 无敌重头戏 ∮ - ∮ 无敌重头戏 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Showtime ∮ - ∮ Showtime ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.29,0:31:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 看看是谁回来了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Guess who's back again ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.79,0:31:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 不知道吗 ∮ - ∮ 告诉他们 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Oh, they don't know? ∮ - ∮ Go on, tell 'em ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.56,0:31:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 还不知道吗 ∮ - ∮ 快告诉他们 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Oh, they don't know? ∮ - ∮ Go on, tell 'em ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.19,0:31:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等我们上场时一切都将揭晓 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll bet they know as soon as we walk in ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.23,0:31:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 秀起来 ∮ - ∮ 古巴大链子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Sho' 'nuff ∮ - ∮ I'm wearin' Cuban links ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.46,0:31:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 最新款貂皮大衣 ∮ - ∮ 没错 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Designer'minks ∮ - ∮ Yeah ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.70,0:31:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别再看了 小心受打击 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't look too hard, might hurt yourself ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.80,0:32:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小心撞得遍体鳞伤 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Known to give the color red The blues ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.47,0:32:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 都愣着干嘛呢 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Tell me whatcha tryin' to do ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.18,0:32:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 闪耀着金光的魔法在空气中璀璨夺目 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ 24-karat magic in the air ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.78,0:32:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.29,0:32:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 月亮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Moon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.59,0:32:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 小妞们 ∮ - ∮ 都愣着干嘛 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Girls ∮ - ∮ What y'all tryin' to do? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.14,0:32:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 小妞们 ∮ - ∮ 都愣着干嘛 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ Girls ∮ - ∮ What y'all tryin' to do? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.84,0:32:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 纯金的24K璀璨 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ 24-karat… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.71,0:32:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 同志们 快把你们的戒指甩向天际 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Put yo' pinky rings up to the moon ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.89,0:32:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有型噢 Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work it, Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.89,0:32:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.76,0:33:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉哟 不错噢 Drac\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Lookin' good, Drac!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.43,0:33:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好啦 Frank\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling good, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 帅得不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you, so fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.37,0:33:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? This? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.94,0:33:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 打扮得让姑娘印象深刻 啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Dressed to impress, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.94,0:33:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么印象深刻 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Impress"? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.57,0:33:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要让谁印象深刻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do I need to impress?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 那不是Ericka船长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, isn't that Captain Ericka?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.34,0:33:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不不不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.91,0:33:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 什么 啊 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what? Eh, oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.25,0:33:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀 看错了 不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops, no, not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.22,0:33:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢哈哈哈哈 这也太好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.85,0:33:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很有趣哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.36,0:33:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 Drac 我们从没见过你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Drac. You know, it's just we've never seen you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.26,0:33:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.50,0:33:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事根本讲不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.90,0:33:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能心动两次的 这绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't Zing twice, it's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.64,0:33:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确实心动了 所以现在该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did! So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.94,0:33:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis又会怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Mavis?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.61,0:33:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她希望你开心 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants you to be happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.74,0:33:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信她会顺其自然就接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure she'll go with the flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.58,0:33:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis需要我 我还要保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis needs me. She depends on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.78,0:33:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和家人待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be home with my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.85,0:34:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Murray家是在埃及 但你可是住在尼罗河畔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Murray here may be from Egypt, but you're the one in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.96,0:34:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「顺其自然」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"da Nile."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.00,0:34:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.66,0:34:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷噢 你正好打到了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! You hit me right in the…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.93,0:34:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 不然我在梦里也饶不了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say a word, or I'll haunt your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.47,0:34:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩得开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.28,0:34:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你来了我现在更开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm having even more fun now that you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.68,0:34:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 能和你一起出来旅行我觉得很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dad, I feel really lucky to have this time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.78,0:34:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人都在一起 这经历太珍贵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us together, it's really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.68,0:34:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 你个小机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too, spider monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.59,0:34:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在你准备好迎接怪兽排球的挑战了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, are you ready for me to destroy you in monster ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.86,0:34:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢 怪兽排球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Monster ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.63,0:34:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 Drac外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Papa Drac!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.89,0:34:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.60,0:34:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是家里的游戏之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I am king of family fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.84,0:34:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 好了 准备好接球了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha! All right! Who is ready to get pummeled?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.04,0:34:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得提醒你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to warn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.28,0:34:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可在Santa Cruz学校排球赛中 排名第二的队伍里练过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I played second-team coed intramural volleyball at Santa Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.28,0:34:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 朋友 随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, pal. Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.98,0:35:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 请注意点我的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, just please watch the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.72,0:35:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要弄乱我的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.55,0:35:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢 噢 开始吧 让我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh-ho-ho! Let's go! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.96,0:35:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢太棒了 这比赛肯定有趣极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh, this is gonna be so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.42,0:35:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha! Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.79,0:35:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,球来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好 大力扣杀 - 别碰我头发别碰我头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spike! - Not the hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.83,0:35:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.54,0:35:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.01,0:35:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.91,0:35:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ericka船长 甲板需要您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Ericka, you are needed on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站 永别Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next stop… Buh-bye, Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.48,0:35:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 看球 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha! All right, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.34,0:35:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢看着吧 我能接住这个球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.78,0:36:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看向这里 怪兽们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.34,0:36:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.78,0:36:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 我说什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! What'd I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.78,0:36:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即将抵达我们行程的第一站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're arriving at our first destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.56,0:36:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,水下火山\N{\fnArial\fs30}The underwater volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.80,0:36:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人带好你们的潜水装备 准备开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, grab your scuba gear and get ready to explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.90,0:36:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,深海探险之旅吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wonders of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.94,0:36:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.90,0:36:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dracula伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.71,0:36:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟听到了吗 她看上你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that, pal? She likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.45,0:36:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.81,0:36:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来她也心动得不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like a Zing in full effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.88,0:36:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.78,0:36:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 就是 就是 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.49,0:36:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这儿就是享受天伦之乐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here to have family fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.12,0:36:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭聚会 真呀么真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family, family, fun, fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.05,0:37:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我看看 放这里怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, let's see. What about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位请往这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.12,0:37:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到水下王国的奇迹之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to one of the true wonders of the underwater kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.09,0:37:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,向您呈现Fuego火山\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you Volcano del Fuego.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.62,0:37:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人称之为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, as the local sea life call it…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.34,0:39:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 多么可爱的一家人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, what a cute family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.88,0:39:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.95,0:39:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 坏蛋Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh! Dracula bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.69,0:41:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 我们才刚刚吃过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, we just ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.06,0:41:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然又饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you're hungry already.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.23,0:41:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但是你知道是为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.96,0:41:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是因为我周围游满了海鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all… Just all that seafood just swimming around,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.90,0:41:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我一看见吃的就\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I "see food…"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.86,0:41:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点出息吧 我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man! I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.97,0:41:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Dracula，Dracula，Dracula！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Dracula, Dracula, Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.90,0:41:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dracula Dracula\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dracula, Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.97,0:41:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明明离他那么近了 但感觉他像是在戏弄我一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get so close, but it's almost like he's teasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.08,0:41:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在 忍无可忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, I can't stand it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.31,0:41:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.39,0:41:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道嘛 水下火山看上去超级热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that underwater volcano looked hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.83,0:41:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.40,0:41:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嗨 Bob\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Hi, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.33,0:42:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我们刚刚答应你的 呃 现在去打乒乓球吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. We promised you we'd play, uh, ping-pong now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.30,0:42:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 Dennis 这位是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Dennis? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.87,0:42:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这是我们的朋友 Bob\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's our friend, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.94,0:42:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说个嗨 Bob - 嗨 Bob\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say hi, Bob. - "Hi, Bob."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.25,0:42:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 去打乒乓球咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Time to go play ping-pong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.25,0:42:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Drac！- Drac！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drac! - Drac!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.38,0:42:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Drac！- Drac！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drac! - Drac!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.82,0:42:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 是哪里着火啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boys, where's the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.02,0:42:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 嗯 是Griffin 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, Griffin here, he…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.39,0:42:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有话想和你说 - 我么 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has something to tell you. - Me? Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.76,0:42:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 我手上被咬了一下 然后 因为 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yeah, I got this bite on my hand, and since, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.13,0:42:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这方面的专家 我想你帮我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a biting expert, I thought you could take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.43,0:42:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 来这边 - 光线好一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Come on over here. - The light is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.23,0:42:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.47,0:42:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.87,0:42:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙正常的时候都够奇怪了 现在比平常还要奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are acting weirder than normal, and your normal is pretty weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.91,0:42:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信我听到什么了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not gonna believe what we heard, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.51,0:42:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Ericka爱上了Drac ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ericka loves the Drac ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.92,0:42:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她对Drac的爱没个够 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ She can't get enough of that Drac ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.15,0:42:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 噢 耶 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, yeah ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.12,0:42:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Drac回来啦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Drac is back ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.42,0:42:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他又心动啦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He's got the Zing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.13,0:42:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 心动呀动 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The Zinga-Zing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.96,0:42:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 我告诉过你 我不想让Mavis不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. I told you I don't want to upset Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.40,0:43:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都在说些什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.13,0:43:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听着 Frank饿了 这没什么稀奇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, see, Frank got hungry, so no surprise there…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.43,0:43:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们游回船的时候发现 Erica对你赞不绝口呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we swam back to the ship, and we found Ericka raving about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.30,0:43:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 没了你她活不下去啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't live without you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.14,0:43:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.88,0:43:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 宝贝儿 让心动时刻来临 你无法抗拒 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You can't deny the Zing, baby ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.91,0:43:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac 这太棒了 你会对她开始行动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Drac, this is great. Are you gonna make a move on the captain, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.32,0:43:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.95,0:43:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 不行 - 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe? No. - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.45,0:43:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太突然了 我都不知道该从哪开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while. I don't even know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.79,0:43:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很简单啊 Drac 就找些小话题聊聊嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy, Drac. Just make some small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.19,0:43:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得要微笑 - 要看着她的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember to smile. - Look into her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.03,0:43:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随意一点 - 风趣幽默一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep it casual. - Say something funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.03,0:43:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问她 她的身体部位都是哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her where her parts are from.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.30,0:43:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 夸夸她的缠身布很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and say that her wrappings look nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.00,0:43:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢住棺材吗 - 夸她就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Do you like coffins?" - Compliment her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.80,0:43:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夸她脖子看上去诱人好吃 - 她来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Your neck looks delicious." - Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.80,0:43:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 Drac 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Drac, hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.21,0:43:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你诱人的脖子被缠身布裹在一个漂亮的棺材里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your delicious neck wrappings are in a nice coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.41,0:43:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看看我的身体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to see my parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.11,0:43:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我十分愿意跟你约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'd love to go out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.21,0:43:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ay! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.45,0:43:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.58,0:43:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒吧 今晚12点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cantina. Midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.98,0:43:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要迟到噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.83,0:44:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.03,0:44:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真险啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.04,0:44:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 别跑 Tinkles 别跑 - 等等 Tinkles 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! Stop it, Tinkles, stop! - Wait, Tinkles. Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.61,0:44:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tinkles 别跑 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tinkles, stop! - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.12,0:44:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.46,0:44:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tinkles 不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tinkles, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.60,0:44:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被发现啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been found!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.07,0:44:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都不会抓到我的 怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never get me, monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.07,0:44:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 Tinkles 停下 嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Tinkles, stop. Shh! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.93,0:45:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们即将抵达下一站 浪漫荒岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, we are pulling up to our next stop, the Deserted Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.40,0:45:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候在沙滩上狂欢啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to get lost on the beach,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.67,0:45:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望你们玩得开心 放松身心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we hope you'll find yourself some fun and relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.41,0:45:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔喔 沙滩时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Beach time!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.58,0:45:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny 你去安置好所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, you go set everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.42,0:45:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有爸爸 你去排队拿冰沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Dad, you go get in line for the snow cones.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.35,0:45:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我在想你和Johnny\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, actually, I was thinking you and Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.12,0:45:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该多花些时间呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}should spend some time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.96,0:45:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次是怎么说的来着 呃 约会之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call it again? Eh, date night?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.39,0:45:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Date night?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.93,0:45:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你又打算做什么呢 - 我打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you gonna do? - Well, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.69,0:45:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,和大伙们借着这次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and the guys would take this opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.06,0:45:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,与Dennis共度美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}to spend some quality time with Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.17,0:45:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧 是个不错的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay. That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.04,0:45:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 Johnny 约会之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Johnny. Date night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.70,0:45:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哒哒哒哒 约会之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duh-duh-duh-duh-date night!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.36,0:46:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 去拿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.30,0:46:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真棒 - 这次换我扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good girl! - I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.14,0:46:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.64,0:46:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去好像是我们的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.54,0:46:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还真是我们的孩子们 跑啊 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is our children! Run! - Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.38,0:46:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 来个人 请救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Help! Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.45,0:46:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一下他们父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.42,0:46:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 来帮我在背上擦点防晒霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank? Would you rub some moonscreen on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.35,0:46:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得被月亮晒伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I get burned?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.99,0:46:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait one second, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.19,0:46:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孩子把我埋在沙里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the kids buried me in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.03,0:46:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Thanks, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.70,0:46:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来一杯吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we have another? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.20,0:47:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉真好 - 干了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds good. - Straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.54,0:47:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方是不是很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this place amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔呜 菜单是装在瓶子里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! The menu is in a bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.68,0:47:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太天才啦 是不是棒极了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genius! Isn't that awesome, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.08,0:47:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 噢 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.71,0:47:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想着我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking about my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.72,0:47:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得他最近奇奇怪怪的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think he's acting weird lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.62,0:47:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得啊 除了十分迷恋船长之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really. Besides having a huge crush on the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.06,0:47:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 没错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.03,0:47:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱情的小船肯定会再次扬帆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Love Boat is definitely making another run.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.59,0:47:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. He's…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.36,0:47:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是我老爸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.63,0:47:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 我懂 是有些奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right? It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.43,0:47:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是现在 当我父母亲亲时 我都还是闭着眼睛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my parents kiss, I still close my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.27,0:47:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是从未想过 爸爸会和妈妈以外的人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I never thought about him with anyone besides my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.58,0:47:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使这样 你还是可以接受的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cool with it, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.08,0:47:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我希望他幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I want him to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.21,0:47:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.28,0:47:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.36,0:47:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buenas noches, mi amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.83,0:48:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有 「饮料」 可以 解我的渴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you a beverage to quench me of my parchment?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.83,0:48:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 当然有 Chupacabra先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course, Mr. Chupacabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.24,0:48:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muchas gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.13,0:48:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look ravishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.46,0:48:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.56,0:48:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 谢谢 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, thank you. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.76,0:48:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.31,0:48:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 唔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.17,0:48:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ericka船长姓什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Captain Ericka have a last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 噢 啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, oh, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.71,0:48:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 Guacamole （鳄梨酱）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, guacamole!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.85,0:48:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Ericka Guacamole」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ericka Guacamole"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.38,0:48:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真洋气\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so international.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.72,0:49:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们应该一起尝尝鳄梨酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Guacamole for us to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.52,0:49:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 今晚的月色多美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how beautiful is that full moon tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.89,0:49:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 就在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.73,0:49:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这里的食物真是让人食指大动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm! The food here is to die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.84,0:49:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 好多鳄梨酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy moly, that was a lot of guacamole.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.78,0:49:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.15,0:49:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很好 怎么了 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Totally fine. Why? - No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.69,0:49:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.36,0:49:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳄梨酱里一定有大蒜\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must have been garlic in the guacamole.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.79,0:49:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.33,0:49:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说是不是很致命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that deadly for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.80,0:49:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 只是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It's just that I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.70,0:49:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大蒜不耐受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garlic intolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.68,0:49:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你放的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:50:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.45,0:50:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.68,0:50:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚冲浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dolphin surfing!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.46,0:50:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.59,0:50:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 妈妈 嗨 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mama. Hi, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.53,0:50:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey-hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.67,0:50:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.40,0:50:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Papa. - Hidey-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.40,0:50:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸也在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my dad in there, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.31,0:50:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我在这儿呢 「给我血 给我血”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'm over here. Bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.58,0:50:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 外公不在这里 他去约会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Papa Drac's not here. He's on his date.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.38,0:50:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Date?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.38,0:50:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.85,0:50:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是太紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just very nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.56,0:50:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.53,0:50:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我妻子去世后 我就再也没有约过会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had a date since my wife died.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.80,0:50:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿那时候多大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old was your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.73,0:50:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was just an infant.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.70,0:50:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一个单身父亲真的不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was hard being a single dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.67,0:50:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I did my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.88,0:51:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也从没见过我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew my mother, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.65,0:51:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.81,0:51:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.02,0:51:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁抚养你长大呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who raised you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.55,0:51:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的曾祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}My great-grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.62,0:51:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎是在这艘船上长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I basically grew up on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.32,0:51:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你现在是船长了呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're a captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.56,0:51:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这就是我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's all I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.83,0:51:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里人期望我成这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.30,0:51:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 家庭嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a family thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.80,0:51:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 家庭就是一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, family is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.74,0:51:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在尊重过去的同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to honor the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.51,0:51:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we make our own future.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.02,0:51:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - Mavis\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - Mavis!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.02,0:51:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - Johnny\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mmm. - Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.93,0:51:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚和Ericka船长在讨论酒店行业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Ericka and I were just discussing the hospitality industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.97,0:52:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是工作的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just work stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.04,0:52:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're working now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.60,0:52:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本该来这儿度假啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is supposed to be a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.51,0:52:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}A family vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.91,0:52:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一些 船长的事情 要去处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should really go do captain-y things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.54,0:52:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你说过你会和Dennis呆在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you said you were gonna spend time with Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.58,0:52:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis。Dennis？Dennis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis. Dennis? Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.78,0:52:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你说得对 那孩子去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Yeah, you're right. Where is that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.55,0:52:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Denisovich 你应该待在我身边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denisovich? You're supposed to be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.09,0:52:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 孩子 现在是家庭时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now, kid, it's family time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.36,0:52:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再藏了 Dennis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit hiding. Dennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.43,0:52:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.63,0:52:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你爸爸的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean your dad's date?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.93,0:52:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是约会 这是 工作上的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a date. It was work stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.93,0:52:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.10,0:52:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 Johnny\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, Johnny,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.94,0:52:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is something about that woman I don't trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.77,0:52:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你希望你爸爸幸福 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you want your dad to be happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.87,0:52:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.38,0:52:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不能是和她在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.41,0:52:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 喔呼呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Whoo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.11,0:52:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.55,0:52:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个鳄梨酱里都是大蒜噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guac is loaded with garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.72,0:52:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大蒜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garlic?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.52,0:52:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是动听的曲调呀 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! That was a cute toot, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.11,0:53:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们一整晚都在玩耶 - 我们也要玩一整个白天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've been up all night! - Let's stay up all day, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.95,0:53:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们狂欢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.56,0:53:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ericka！-什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ericka! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.56,0:53:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚去哪里了 姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just where have you been, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.93,0:53:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 在工作而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, doing work.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.40,0:53:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴着那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.40,0:53:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚和他在一起 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were with him! I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.94,0:53:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.91,0:53:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 你心里知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who?" You know who!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.04,0:53:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你其实一直在背着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been sneaking around my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.61,0:53:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,又想偷偷地杀掉Dracula 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to kill Dracula again, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.95,0:53:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是又怎样 我现在可是个成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if I have? I am a grown woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.75,0:53:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权杀掉任何一个我想要的杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the right to kill whoever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.05,0:54:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不仅仅是你一个人的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.52,0:54:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会破坏掉家族事业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have ruined the legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.83,0:54:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他发现你是谁怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he discovered who you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.60,0:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我没想那么多 但他这个人不知怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I wasn't thinking. There's just something about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.90,0:54:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that just drives me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.84,0:54:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 我看到他 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, I see him, and I want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.97,0:54:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.11,0:54:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 估计是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.81,0:54:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及想要解决他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, I can't wait to get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.88,0:54:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 不会太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, it won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.11,0:54:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你拿到了无敌破坏乐谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you recover the instrument of destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.55,0:54:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没人能阻止我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.55,0:54:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连Dracula也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even Dracula!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.49,0:54:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 打扰了 - 间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Excuse me. - Spies!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.53,0:54:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 赶快 趁还没有人来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, quickly, before someone comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.98,0:55:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家在甲板上集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone assemble on the forward deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.62,0:55:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经到达了我们的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are arriving at our final destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.52,0:55:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,从世界的深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the depths of creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.09,0:55:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座伟大的城市将再次出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mighty city has risen once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.83,0:55:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最伟大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home to the greatest monster civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.63,0:55:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽文明之乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world has ever known,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.53,0:55:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它优雅 精致 其艺术 文化远超罗马和雅典\N{\fnArial\fs30}far surpassing Athens and Rome in art, culture and sophistication.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.24,0:55:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为您介绍传说中失落的城市 亚特兰提斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you the legendary lost city of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.70,0:55:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 超级大海怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a giant Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.87,0:55:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有一个地方你一定要去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's a place you've gotta be ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.74,0:56:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 数千部落藏匿于海 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A thousand leagues beneath the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.08,0:56:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 它在等着我和你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And it's waiting over here for you and me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.28,0:56:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 将要带你去旅行 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Gonna take you for a ride ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.55,0:56:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但首先你得先进来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But first you've gotta come inside ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.92,0:56:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 为今晚的派对做好准备 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Get ready, for the party's on tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.86,0:56:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所以只要放松和放松 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So relax and just unwind ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.07,0:56:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把你的烦恼全都抛在脑后 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Leave your worries all behind ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.57,0:56:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 为今晚的派对做好准备 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And get ready, for the party's on tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.95,0:56:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来亚特兰蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Atlantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.92,0:56:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所以 准备好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So get ready ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.62,0:56:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 准备好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ready ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.83,0:56:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.86,0:56:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 派对时间到了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's party time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.97,0:57:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 派对时间到了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's party time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.81,0:57:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 太刺激了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. I am so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.94,0:57:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.88,0:57:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh - 28点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. - Twenty-eight black!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.82,0:57:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 不 你不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ahhh! - Oh, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.32,0:57:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次你赌博输掉了一支手和一条腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time you gambled, you lost an arm and a leg. Literally!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.32,0:57:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 替换你的四肢… - 我再加到40\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Replacement limbs… - I'll raise you 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.33,0:57:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不像以前那么容易啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}…aren't just lying around like they were in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.80,0:57:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不准赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.10,0:57:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.23,0:57:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 亲爱的 我知道了 不赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, dear! Got it! No gambling!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.71,0:57:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tinkles停下 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tinkles, stop. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.38,0:57:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下来 Tinkles停下来 - Ah 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it, Tinkles, stop. - Ah! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.18,0:57:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们见到Mavis了吗 我得找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you guys seen Mavis? I have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.22,0:57:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦 出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.72,0:57:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉她关于Ericka的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to tell her about Ericka.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.76,0:57:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再对我的女儿说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lie to my own daughter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.22,0:57:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对我来说是世界上最重要的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the most important person in the world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.13,0:58:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须告诉她真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.33,0:58:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 在这之前我得先和Ericka谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after I talk to Ericka.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.44,0:58:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.87,0:58:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我全都\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm all…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.21,0:58:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 你知道自已在做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, are you sure you know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.28,0:58:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 我全押\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this. I'm all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.15,0:58:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny 你看见我爸爸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, have you seen my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.08,0:58:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有可能和 Bob在一起 - 他为什么会和Bob在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he's with Bob. - Why would he be with Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.82,0:58:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bob是一个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob's a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.82,0:58:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh 他在那 - 谁 Bob吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, there he is. - Who? Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.24,0:58:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那呀 嗨 Bob\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! Hi, Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.53,1:00:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.17,1:01:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.89,1:01:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.36,1:01:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Why wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.29,1:01:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不相信 你会为了一个人类这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe you would do that for a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.93,1:01:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 怪兽 有什么区别呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans, monsters, what's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.96,1:02:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是的 说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.00,1:02:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.24,1:02:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 恩 你知道 吸血鬼能预见未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh… Well, you know, vampires can predict the future,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.07,1:02:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我知道你会需要我的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I knew you would need my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.11,1:02:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛 以前怎么没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! Never heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.35,1:02:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 哈哈 这是众所周知的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah. It's a well-known fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.62,1:02:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.28,1:02:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.42,1:02:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我来这里是为了拿那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm here to get that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.52,1:02:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这是个传家宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a family heirloom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.49,1:02:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 它本来掉到海里了 我的祖父 曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was lost at sea, and my great-grandfather is… Was!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.13,1:02:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一度很执着的想要找回它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, was totally obsessed with getting it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.46,1:02:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 那个 谢谢你救了我的命 但是我自己可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anywho, thanks for saving my life, but I can take it from…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.64,1:02:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多加小心噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to be a little more careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.18,1:02:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能救我多少次呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times can you save my life, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.08,1:02:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 大概每一次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Every time?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.55,1:02:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Well, then…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.54,1:03:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.68,1:03:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.32,1:04:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是还要去取你的传家宝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to get your family heirloom thingy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.26,1:04:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.33,1:04:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.36,1:04:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 让我帮你拿掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here, let me get that for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.50,1:04:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.84,1:04:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.60,1:04:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在对我父亲做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.41,1:04:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Whoa. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.38,1:04:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis 停下 放她下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis, stop! Put her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.64,1:04:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她想要伤害你 你难道看不出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! She's trying to hurt you. Why can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.55,1:05:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.42,1:05:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我心动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I Zinged.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.65,1:05:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.15,1:05:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我对Ericka动心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Zinged with Ericka.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.86,1:05:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不可能是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.16,1:05:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能有一次心动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only Zing once.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.70,1:05:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾这么以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.33,1:05:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,心动 什么是心动\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Zing"? What's a Zing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.63,1:05:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是怪兽的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, it's a thing for monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.67,1:05:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是人类所说的 一见钟情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like our "love at first sight."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.48,1:05:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 不 不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.31,1:05:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你甚至都不了解我 - 暂时而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't even know me. - Well, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.65,1:05:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我们正要 - 不 你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we're just… - No, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.15,1:05:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.68,1:05:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会和像你这样的人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never be with someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.62,1:05:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会爱上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never be with.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.69,1:05:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.53,1:05:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.30,1:05:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.41,1:06:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见她说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what she said.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.72,1:06:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是心动 不会错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a Zing never lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.83,1:06:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 你得手啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.90,1:06:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.57,1:06:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们得到了无敌破坏乐谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we have the instrument of destruction,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.28,1:06:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将会完成家族的传承\N{\fnArial\fs30}our family legacy will be fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.21,1:06:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 我们得把他们引到一个舞会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, we'll draw them in with a dance party!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.72,1:06:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love to dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.37,1:07:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 帮我拉下拉链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, could you zip me up?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.94,1:07:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.90,1:07:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪搞到的这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get those?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.21,1:07:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 这事说来有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, see, here's the funny thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.41,1:07:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌博把手输掉了 但没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my hands gambling, but… It's no big deal!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.31,1:07:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我在海鲜自助台上找到了这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I got these from the seafood buffet.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.38,1:07:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个 我夹 我夹 我夹 夹 夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Clickety-click, click, clack, clack, click, click.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.75,1:07:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还蛮喜欢这对钳子 很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of like 'em. I like 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.99,1:07:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm! Mmm! Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.59,1:07:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.40,1:07:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.99,1:07:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得派对在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I guess the party's this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.82,1:07:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.89,1:07:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.70,1:08:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.40,1:08:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们燥起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this party started right!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.97,1:08:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇呜 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoo-hoo! - All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.44,1:08:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.81,1:08:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.41,1:08:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他们说派对在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they said the party was this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.74,1:08:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝壳里的DJ\N{\fnArial\fs30}DJ in a clamshell?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.94,1:08:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是羡慕 嫉妒 恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.09,1:09:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 我爸居然爱上了一个想杀他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe my dad Zinged with someone who's trying to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.06,1:09:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真爱的确会让人做出些疯狂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the Zing makes you do crazy things.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.47,1:09:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 Johnny？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.70,1:09:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是 你要明白 爱是一个永恒之谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's most important to understand is that love is an infinite enigma.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.47,1:09:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,远远超出了我们的理解范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is beyond our understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.74,1:09:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经 你我是两个独立的人 两个世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I were two halves, a world apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.11,1:10:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是冥冥之中 在命运的指引下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then we followed the strands of destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.15,1:10:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相遇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and were brought together.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.92,1:10:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我融为了一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our halves made one whole.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.89,1:10:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果她和他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if she and he…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.09,1:10:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要放下消极看法 审视内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must release all the negativity and look within.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.66,1:10:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,心与心的结合 是分不开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bond is unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.83,1:10:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 亲爱的 哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, honey. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.90,1:10:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.40,1:10:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇爸爸 你听起来好聪明啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, you sounded pretty smart, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.77,1:10:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这些嘛 是我小时候最喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that? Yeah, it was just the philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.81,1:10:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国武术电视节目里的少林功夫大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Sifu Sing from my favorite TV show when I was a kid,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.57,1:10:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所传授的哲学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kung Fu Shaolin Monk Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.18,1:10:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 接着来跳舞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, let's get back to dancing!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.84,1:10:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.15,1:10:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你一定要和Ericka谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad? You have to talk to Ericka.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.72,1:10:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.82,1:10:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I said before,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.65,1:10:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我有一丢丢反应过度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but maybe I overreacted a teensy bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.52,1:10:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是害怕失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the thought of losing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.83,1:10:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你在说什么啊 失去我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you talking about, losing me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.96,1:10:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啊 要是你结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously, after you get married,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.00,1:10:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会呆在这艘船上 然后去环游世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna live on the ship and travel around the world…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.97,1:10:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢噢噢 等等 Mavis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Slow down, Mavis.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.57,1:10:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两件事是我可以向你保证的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two things I can promise you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.81,1:11:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 没有什么能把我和你 还有咱们这个家分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, nothing can ever take me from you and all my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.64,1:11:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 我也绝不会住在一艘船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, I will never live on a boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.45,1:11:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远是我的可爱小蛛蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my cute little tarantula.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.92,1:11:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能离开你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I ever leave you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.06,1:11:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 现在 快去找她谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, seriously, go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.06,1:11:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能去 你也听见她说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. You heard what she said,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.46,1:11:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不可能跟我这样的吸血鬼在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}she could never be with someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.16,1:11:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸 你现在不完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dad. You're just a half,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.50,1:11:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须听从命运的安排 找到另一半 成为一个永恒的整体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have to follow your destiny to find an infinite whole.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.00,1:11:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这语气 真像Johnny\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.84,1:11:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码 你不能否认你的心动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, you can't deny a Zing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.74,1:11:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽 人类 独角兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster, human, unicorn…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.51,1:11:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.24,1:11:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 去找她吧 就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go to her! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.01,1:11:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.15,1:11:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 朋友 你不能在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, you're not allowed up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.69,1:11:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的DJ棚可不是谁都能进的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The DJ booth is a sacred space.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.19,1:11:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 Tinkles 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Tinkles, quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.20,1:11:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.73,1:12:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我知道你认得我 你最大的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha! I know you recognize me, your greatest rival.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.14,1:12:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 噢 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.04,1:12:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不就是机场下面那家假日酒店的老板吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You own that Holiday Inn down by the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.14,1:12:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我 Abraham Van Helsing\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! It is I, Abraham Van Helsing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.78,1:12:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Van Helsing？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Van Helsing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.25,1:12:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,都过这么多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all these years?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.12,1:12:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来不咋地啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.25,1:12:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的嘴总是这么讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always with the quick insults.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.22,1:12:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓 反正它会让你闭嘴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this will shut you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.76,1:12:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有所有的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.66,1:12:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 这个 不就是Ericka的传家宝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, huh? That's just Ericka's family heirloom thingy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.70,1:12:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好曾孙女 Ericka\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one, Ericka.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.20,1:12:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ericka？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ericka?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.74,1:12:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.10,1:12:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可不光是船长呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only is she the ship's captain,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.97,1:12:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还碰巧是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she also happens to be…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.21,1:12:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你来告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.25,1:12:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的曾孙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his great-granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.25,1:12:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Ericka Van Helsing\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ericka Van Helsing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.99,1:12:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道她不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew there was something wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.99,1:12:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.26,1:13:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情是这样的 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, what happened…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.06,1:13:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们都在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we're all caught up,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.10,1:13:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一起受死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get back to the dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.93,1:13:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊 这是能灭掉所有怪兽的宝物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, the key to the demise of all monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.85,1:13:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拭目以待啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.15,1:13:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right… Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.86,1:13:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听这旋律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to the melody.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.03,1:13:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们的催命符\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.00,1:13:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 瞧瞧这个小玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, what's this little doodad do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.70,1:13:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.69,1:14:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看啊 是海怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look! It's the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.68,1:14:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 马上撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody out! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.29,1:14:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没路了 大家后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped! Everybody back!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.08,1:15:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.46,1:15:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.06,1:15:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.94,1:15:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切该结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to stop now!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.94,1:15:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drac, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.94,1:15:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.92,1:15:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.42,1:15:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mavis！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mavis!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.93,1:15:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不朽的Dracula 你的死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for the immortal Dracula to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.84,1:16:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.15,1:16:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.78,1:16:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ericka！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ericka!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.96,1:16:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bob 快来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.22,1:16:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.83,1:16:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Tinkles吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tinkles?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.96,1:16:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dennis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.13,1:16:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢不 Bob就是Tinkles吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Bob is Tinkles?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.83,1:16:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.23,1:16:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但感谢上帝 还好他来了 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thank goodness he did, 'cause look!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.18,1:17:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.44,1:17:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对怪兽有误解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong about monsters!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.45,1:17:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dracula 他救过我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dracula… He saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.32,1:17:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.59,1:17:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉 Drac\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Drac.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.45,1:17:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前一直在找机会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to kill you this whole time,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.92,1:17:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来我发现自己犯了大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then I realized how wrong I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.49,1:17:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wrong all of this is.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.03,1:17:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知不觉中 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.90,1:17:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你心动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Zinged.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.37,1:17:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么「心动」 你在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Zing"? What's a Zing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.30,1:17:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怪兽界的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a monster thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.57,1:17:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.37,1:17:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似「真爱」这种说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like true love.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.97,1:17:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.41,1:17:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我想 这个家族事业由我来终结吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess the legacy ends with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.18,1:17:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔 真是个尴尬的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, that's an awkward ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.12,1:17:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.32,1:17:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候开始新的传承了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to start a new legacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.99,1:17:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽与人类之间的传承\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster-human legacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.63,1:17:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.30,1:18:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac醒醒 Van Helsing的音乐正在控制那个巨大的章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drac! Van Helsing's beats are controlling the giant octopus thingy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.24,1:18:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说我有什么讨厌的东西 那就是邪恶的DJ\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's one thing I hate, it's an evil DJ.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.24,1:18:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要正能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need positive energy!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.35,1:18:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备来一场DJ之间的对决吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready for a DJ battle!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.49,1:18:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随身都带着那些装备的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just carry all that stuff around with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.42,1:18:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一日为DJ 终身为DJ\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once a bar mitzvah DJ, always a bar mitzvah DJ.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.63,1:18:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要用美好之音来战胜他的邪恶之声\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna use good music to defeat his evil music.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.50,1:18:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说啥 - 相信我 我懂音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Trust me, I know the tunes,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.13,1:18:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你拥有魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you've got the power.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.03,1:18:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好勒 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay.
