Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.64,1:19:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在 Drac\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Drac!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.35,1:20:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不必担忧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So don't worry ∮
