Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.35,1:20:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 - 歌词寓意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - It has a nice message.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.59,1:20:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不必担忧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't worry ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.76,1:20:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快乐一点 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Be happy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.77,1:20:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经受够了这些乱七八糟的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough of this nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.23,1:20:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnny 我们需要的是最能洗脑的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, we need the most brain-dominating,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.56,1:20:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要全宇宙历史上最能打动人的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}toe-tappinating song in the history of all the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.70,1:20:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 那首歌到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.37,1:21:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.51,1:21:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里实在有太多歌曲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many choices.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.75,1:21:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.75,1:21:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.36,1:21:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.28,1:21:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这歌 真不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that stinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.47,1:22:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Johnny选的老调音乐打败了邪恶音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Johnny's corny music is defeating the evil music.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.47,1:22:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点喜欢它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.80,1:22:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.23,1:22:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.25,1:22:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀 哎 嗷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh! Ahhh! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.58,1:22:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被这节奏给洗脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a slave to the rhythm!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.83,1:23:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.40,1:23:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drac 你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drac, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.33,1:23:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能心中永远充满仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be greater than the haters!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.37,1:23:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.28,1:23:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.32,1:23:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 在我做了那么多伤害你的事情之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, after everything,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.22,1:23:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却还要救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you save my life?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.36,1:23:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为从本质上来说我们都是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because basically we are all the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.79,1:23:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爪子或手 两只眼睛或者三只眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claws or hands, two eyes or three eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.40,1:23:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绿皮肤 - 没皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Green skin. - No skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.43,1:23:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 易怒的 - 聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prickly. - Brainy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.51,1:23:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.68,1:23:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ew.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.68,1:23:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.50,1:24:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我呀 Dennis 看我呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, Dennis. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.53,1:24:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你不能否认那种感觉噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you can't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.30,1:24:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I'm too young to Zing!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.31,1:24:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我感觉自己现在有点傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I feel kind of silly now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.51,1:24:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,几十年来我一直在追捕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. For decades I have hunted your kind,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.35,1:24:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}persecuted you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.99,1:24:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一能做的就是补偿你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I can do to make it up to you is.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.42,1:24:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}give you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.99,1:24:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,30%的退款\N{\fnArial\fs30}a 30% refund.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.00,1:24:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,少扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preposterous!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.87,1:24:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.70,1:24:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,全额退款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full refund.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.50,1:25:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne Wanda 你们怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne, Wanda, what happened to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.44,1:25:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们 好像在游轮上都没见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we, like, hardly saw you on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.04,1:25:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.34,1:25:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被打了镇定剂 大部分时间都被锁在壁橱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got tranquilized and spent most of the trip locked in a closet.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.31,1:25:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打算下次假期再预定一次这个旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna book it again for the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.02,1:25:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 办理入住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Checking in?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.52,1:25:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.56,1:25:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我已经为您准备好了一间房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I have a room all ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.36,1:25:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 哥们 你能帮我打开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.53,1:25:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.48,1:26:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 怎么了 神神秘秘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what's going on, sneaky pants?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.38,1:26:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 其实也没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.42,1:26:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过 我想确保没有人可以打扰我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, I wanted to make sure nobody would bother us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.46,1:26:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.06,1:26:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要吸我的血吗 「给我血 给我血”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to suck-a my blood? Bleh, bleh-bleh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.63,1:26:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.43,1:26:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.10,1:26:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否愿意嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you would marry me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.81,1:26:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well? What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.94,1:26:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.08,1:26:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.15,1:26:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Woobee deeba doobee？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woobee deeba doobee?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.62,1:26:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.99,1:26:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I… woobee doobeedee?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.40,1:26:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.47,1:27:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 我不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.60,1:27:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
